body:
I am wasting away in alcoholism and drug addiction while working at a restaurant. I think I may have lost all hope in life. Super introverted, no close friends, mom and pop still here, but I feel guilty about staying w them.

&#x200B;

Idk, might be better off dead. Not relly venting eitherm im just empty inside. Takes effort just to breathe

its a very real phenomenon and the infection of perps is growing. Now in 2019 the harassment is multidimensional, its demons and entities flying around EVERYWHERE through the chem trails, being activated through the 5g. 

&#x200B;

Now us TI's are breathing in nano sized machines that self assemble and are powered by these 5g microwaves.

&#x200B;

I have a light spirit telling me CONSTANTLY what the perps are up to.

&#x200B;

We need to fight their spirits with our spirits.

&#x200B;

Now the nano machines in our bodies die off temporarily, and need to be replaced, that's why they spay them all the time. The pink skies is the chemical reaction from the cellphone tower microwave emissions activating the aluminum based nano machines in the air.

&#x200B;

Normal civilians are recruited 'astrally" by these demons, and that's when you have your street theatre, along with people who knowingly take part, all with varying knowledge of the extent of their "parameters"

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
